{"id":3782,"date":"2025-03-20T06:35:00","date_gmt":"2025-03-20T01:05:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/?p=3782"},"modified":"2025-03-20T06:35:00","modified_gmt":"2025-03-20T01:05:00","slug":"dental-implant-doctors-in-chennai","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/dental-implant-doctors-in-chennai\/","title":{"rendered":"Top 10 Dental Implant Doctors in Chennai"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Are you looking for the best <strong>dental implant doctor in Chennai<\/strong>? Our Dr. Dilipkumar, who is one of the best implant doctors in Chennai, offers comprehensive dental implant treatment for all dental necessities.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dental implants are an alternative to natural tooth roots, able to act as a viable stand-in in case of root degradation. Dental implant doctors in Chennai provide holistic services in that regard, from initial consultation to post-implant adjustment. Know the full picture through this article on the best dental implant doctors in Chennai, and how&nbsp; dental implants can change your dental health for the better.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Benefits of Dental Implants in Chennai<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Right off the bat, understanding what a dental implant is and how it can benefit your dental alignment. Your <em>dental implant doctor in Chennai<\/em> will provide all the necessary information regarding the suitability of dental implants for your particular case.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"672\" src=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/benefits-of-dental-implants-in-chennai-1024x672.jpg\" alt=\"benefits of dental implants in Chennai\" class=\"wp-image-4413\" srcset=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/benefits-of-dental-implants-in-chennai-1024x672.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/benefits-of-dental-implants-in-chennai-300x197.jpg 300w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/benefits-of-dental-implants-in-chennai-768x504.jpg 768w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/benefits-of-dental-implants-in-chennai-1536x1008.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/benefits-of-dental-implants-in-chennai.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What are Dental Implants?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>A <strong>dental implant <\/strong>is a synthetic replacement for the roots of your teeth.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>It may be prescribed by your dental specialist in Chennai as an alternative to dental surgery, or as a suitable long-term dental correction solution.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>The artificial replacement is crafted to provide a natural feel to ensure compatibility with daily life and functions.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Dental implants last lifelong, and will be monitored through periodic follow-up appointments with your dentist in Chennai.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Through multiple consultation sessions spanning a few months prior to the procedure itself, your dental specialist will elucidate the process for you, suggesting auxiliary treatments that could streamline the process. They will also discern the main purpose for dental implants, whether aesthetic or functional. In either case, the benefits of getting dental implants are manifold. Some of these include:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bone Tissue Retention<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Loss of bone tissue in the area of a missing tooth is a primary concern and subsequent reason for getting dental implants. Over time, the bone surrounding vacant spaces in your dentures will degrade due to a lack of pressure from a tooth above it. Dental implants are a safe and long-term solution for this problem.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bite and Jawline Correction<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In many cases, people opt for dental implants voluntarily to improve the overall aesthetic of their jawline and smile. Getting dental implants can resolve multiple latent issues that arise from missing teeth, such as sunken skin in your cheekbones.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Better Durability and Natural Feel<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">From an objective standpoint, dental implants offer better resistance to wear-and-tear than typical dentures or bridges. They also create a more natural feel when implanted in your jaw, integrating seamlessly into your bite and teeth alignment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The benefits of getting dental implants are multifold. However, the benefits alone do not rule out the necessity of a thorough dental survey and pre-procedure analysis by your dental implant doctor in Chennai. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Across the various consultations, you will be informed of all the parameters involved in the treatment, from feasibility to the do\u2019s and don\u2019t before, during, and after the procedure. Another major factor to consider is the associated<strong> cost <\/strong>of the procedure, which will be provided to you as an estimate in advance.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dental Implants Cost in Chennai<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1080\" height=\"675\" src=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/dental-implant-cost-in-chennai.jpeg\" alt=\"dental implant cost in Chennai\" class=\"wp-image-4411\" srcset=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/dental-implant-cost-in-chennai.jpeg 1080w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/dental-implant-cost-in-chennai-300x188.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/dental-implant-cost-in-chennai-1024x640.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/dental-implant-cost-in-chennai-768x480.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dental implants classify as a dental surgery procedure. Therefore, your dental implant specialist in Chennai will inform you of a ballpark estimate in procedure costs when the surgery is put forth during dental consultation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It is important to note that this quote is a benchmark for you to gauge the affordability of the procedure, and for insurance purposes too. The final cost of the procedure will depend on any additional treatments to support your dental implants (such as braces), post-implant checkups, among other factors.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Average Cost of Dental Implants in Chennai<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Being one of the eminent metro cities and medical hubs in the country, getting dental implants in Chennai is a go-to choice for many individuals seeking to rectify their dental framework. From a cost perspective, choosing implants offers multifold benefits over other methods such as bridges and dentures.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Depending on your individual case, the overall cost of a dental implant procedure typically ranges from <strong>\u20b925,000 to \u20b950,000<\/strong>. The variables in the price include:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Preoperative tests, such as dental X-rays<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Additional procedures performed as precautionary\/preparatory measures<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Post-surgery follow-up appointments<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your dental implant doctor in Che